      "writtenOn": "2025-02-06T09:45:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s the thing, Dawn should never use non-coherent memory at the moment (see the discussion on the issue) so what we can do is remove all calls to invalidate/flush. Sorry for the confusion.",
      "parentUuid": "2246fb9b_9bef8de4",
      "revId": "adce3e5f129fadc0ddbd5c6a4520f64cb77a6865",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a9335936_d21b3616",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
